{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>When I cloud the cloud.</b> The first nun is rafeh, and it ought to have a dagesh because it belongs to the heavy paradigm-form, like בדברי אתך." "\"And the bow shall be seen\": if we were to believe the words of the sages of Greece, that the bow is generated by the sun's refraction, we would say that HaShem strengthened the sun's light from the time of the Flood, and this is a correct path for the discerning."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:43:57.416881389Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}